From: Adam Durham <amdnative@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:30:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] hyundai: gas-interceptor HOLD feedforward is
 personality-invariant

get_hold_command no longer multiplies the hold feedforward by personality_scale: the
hold term is the one pedal-law component that must be physics (road-load / aero+rolling
resistance against a zero integral term, LongControl ki=0), so scaling it by personality
was an uncorrected steady-state bias (aggressive tracked above its plan, relaxed below).
The pull gain (PEDAL_SCALE) and the per-tier launch ceilings keep their personality
spread; only the hold becomes tier-neutral. personality is retained in the signature for
call compatibility.

Round-3 G3, validated on the G1-fixed harness: standard bit-identical to the shipped
stack (max|dv|=0); relaxed s11 on-ramp t->22 m/s 18.80 -> 16.45 s; both non-standard tiers
move in the intended direction. Python-only, no opendbc/safety and no panda change.
---
 opendbc/sunnypilot/car/hyundai/gas_interceptor.py | 9 +++++++--
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/opendbc/sunnypilot/car/hyundai/gas_interceptor.py b/opendbc/sunnypilot/car/hyundai/gas_interceptor.py
index e106b4d..d3ff7a8 100644
--- a/opendbc/sunnypilot/car/hyundai/gas_interceptor.py
+++ b/opendbc/sunnypilot/car/hyundai/gas_interceptor.py
@@ -186,8 +186,13 @@ def get_pedal_scale(v_ego: float, personality=PERSONALITY_STANDARD) -> float:
 
 
 def get_hold_command(v_ego: float, personality=PERSONALITY_STANDARD) -> float:
-  """Pedal fraction that holds speed on flat ground (accel request 0), scaled by personality."""
-  return personality_scale(personality) * float(np.interp(v_ego, HOLD_CMD_BP, HOLD_CMD_V))
+  """Pedal fraction that holds speed on flat ground (accel request 0). This is a PHYSICS feedforward
+  (road-load / aero+rolling resistance), not a feel dial: it replaces a zero integral term (LongControl
+  ki=0), so any personality scaling of it is an uncorrected bias - aggressive would track above its own
+  plan, relaxed below. Personality-invariant since G3; `personality` is kept in the signature for call
+  compatibility but no longer scales the hold. (personality_scale still applies to the pull gain and the
+  per-tier launch ceilings, which ARE driver-felt.)"""
+  return float(np.interp(v_ego, HOLD_CMD_BP, HOLD_CMD_V))
 
 
 def get_pedal_rate_up(v_ego: float) -> float:
